to make a mortgage decision. The workflow involves using Claude across multiple tabs to research data sources, scrape web data with JavaScript, process CSV files with Python and Daft library, create interactive visualizations with Plotly, and manage the project with Git. The demo emphasizes practical AI-assisted development workflows including voice commands, browser automation, and version control integration.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hiISl558JGE/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-21T15:57:00.000Z"},{"id":"YwFXH3ku1","title":"Claude Code Masterclass","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9UdZhTnMrTA","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/claude-code-masterclass-ywfxh3ku1","summary":"A comprehensive guide sharing 16 lessons learned from 31 months of experience with AI-assisted coding, particularly using Claude Code. Covers practical workflows across small, medium, and large projects including data analysis, voice transcription apps, and web development. Key insights include treating CLI as an advanced RAG tool, breaking complex tasks into smaller steps, using voice input for faster context provision, and maintaining appropriate levels of abstraction when debugging. Demonstrates how AI agents amplify fundamental coding skills rather than replace them, with real-world examples of solving CI/CD issues, optimizing code, and conducting technical analysis.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9UdZhTnMrTA/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-19T18:03:36.000Z"},{"id":"N1kXhMJjR","title":"10 commandments for production ready AI assisted coding","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Xmf8WEpW8Y","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/10-commandments-for-vibe-coding-n1kxhmjjr","summary":"A comprehensive guide presenting 10 commandments for \"vibe coding\" - using AI to write code without checking every line. Key principles include breaking down large problems into smaller pieces, writing extensive tests to guide AI, keeping files under 400 lines, organizing codebases well, and providing relevant context to AI models. The approach emphasizes moving slowly to avoid technical debt, making careful architectural decisions, and eventually using agentic AI that can take actions autonomously. The methodology aims to make AI-assisted coding production-ready while maintaining code quality.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-Xmf8WEpW8Y/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-18T17:05:34.000Z"},{"id":"VOmTyJR03","title":"12 Principles for Coding with AI (Beyond the Basics)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fYWz7pUiwls","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/12-principles-for-coding-with-ai-beyond-the-basics--vomtyjr03","summary":"Programming with chat as the primary model, known as chat-oriented programming (ChOP), is a new paradigm for interacting with code. This post highlights 12 principles for using AI to enhance coding efficiency, emphasizing free AI tools, the importance of context management, effective prompting, and multimodal approaches. The author shares practical examples of how to apply these principles in real projects, such as organizing events, working on text-to-speech applications, and improving production codebases.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fYWz7pUiwls/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":42,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-01T15:00:07.000Z"},{"id":"vovV9dXD6","title":"Is AI Replacing Software Engineering?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pJ5dLwpG0_I","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/is-ai-replacing-software-engineering--vovv9dxd6","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pJ5dLwpG0_I/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-08-15T13:27:00.000Z"},{"id":"oKNs2dw3C","title":"Coding on Windows (and Linux) in 2024?! | Introduction to C# and .NET | Scott Hanselman","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MNN--Ml9XJg","comments_permalink"